+
+Implement ONLY the database layer for email content storage.
+
+Requirements:
+
+1. Modify ONLY:
+   - database.py
+   - models.py
+
+2. Do NOT modify any other files.
+
+3. Preserve all existing functionality.
+
+4. Create a new table named email_content with the following columns:
+
+   - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT)
+   - gmail_id (TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL)
+   - plain_text (TEXT)
+   - html_body (TEXT)
+   - mime_type (TEXT)
+   - content_size (INTEGER)
+   - extracted_at (TIMESTAMP)
+
+5. Add any required indexes.
+
+6. Add safe migration logic so existing databases are upgraded automatically without affecting existing email metadata.
+
+7. If a data model is required, add it to models.py following the existing project style.
+
+8. Do NOT implement:
+   - Gmail API calls
+   - MIME parsing
+   - Content extraction
+   - Synchronization
+   - Application flow changes
+
+9. Keep the project fully functional after the changes.
+
+When finished, stop. Do not implement future batches.

