+- statistics_engine.py
+- models.py (only if absolutely necessary)
+- test_statistics_engine.py
+
+Requirements:
+
+1. Update StatisticsEngine to compute:
+   - total_unique_senders
+   - total_unique_domains
+   - top_10_sender_domains (sorted descending by email count)
+
+2. Use the normalized sender/domain fields already stored in the database.
+   Do NOT parse sender strings again.
+
+3. Return these statistics as part of the existing statistics result object.
+   Do not break any existing API.
+
+4. Add/update tests in test_statistics_engine.py to verify:
+   - unique sender count
+   - unique domain count
+   - correct aggregation of multiple emails from the same domain
+   - descending order of top domains
+
+Rules:
+- Do not refactor unrelated code.
+- Do not change database schema.
+- Do not modify AnalysisEngine.
+- Preserve backward compatibility.
+- Produce complete files only.
+- After implementation, run flake8 on modified files and report the results.

